        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Verifies the customer&apos;s identity as a mandatory step before performing sensitive actions such as password resets, account unlocks, or accessing confidential information.

Verifies the customer&apos;s identity before granting access to sensitive data. Actions like managing cases, retrieving/managing orders, or making a reservation require identity verification. Sensitive data includes confidential, private, or security-protected information, such as business-critical data or personally identifiable information (PII). After verification is successful, don&apos;t repeat the process within the same session.</description>
        <developerName>ServiceCustomerVerification_16jg5000000JwQ5</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
